      "combined": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Cursor-Tracked Spotlight Bento Grid</title>\n  <style>\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody, html {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  background: #09090b;\n  color: #fafafa;\n  font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;\n}\n\n.bento-stage {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 28px;\n}\n\n.bento-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 14px;\n  max-width: 880px;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 720px) {\n  .bento-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n}\n\n.bento-card {\n  --x: -200px;\n  --y: -200px;\n  position: relative;\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n  padding: 26px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  min-height: 185px;\n}\n\n.bento-card.span-2 {\n  grid-column: span 2;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 720px) {\n  .bento-card.span-2 { grid-column: span 1; }\n}\n\n.bento-card::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  border-radius: inherit;\n  background: radial-gradient(380px circle at var(--x) var(--y), rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.55), rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25) 40%, transparent 70%);\n  z-index: 0;\n  opacity: 0;\n  transition: opacity 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.bento-grid:hover .bento-card::before {\n  opacity: 1;\n}\n\n.bento-card::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 1px;\n  border-radius: 13px;\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(320px circle at var(--x) var(--y), rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12), transparent 65%),\n    #111114;\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n.bento-card > * {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 2;\n}\n\n.bento-badge {\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-family: monospace;\n  letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n  color: #a855f7;\n  margin-bottom: 18px;\n}\n\n.bento-card h2 {\n  font-size: 19px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.bento-card p {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.55;\n  color: #a1a1aa;\n}\n\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"bento-stage\">\n    <div class=\"bento-grid\" id=\"bentoGrid\">\n      <article class=\"bento-card span-2\">\n        <div class=\"bento-badge\">01 // ZERO-DEPENDENCY EXTRACTION</div>\n        <h2>Self-Contained Component Bundles</h2>\n        <p>Every card tracks your cursor in real time, illuminating adjacent 1px borders even before the pointer enters the card boundary.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"bento-card\">\n        <div class=\"bento-badge\">02 // 60FPS</div>\n        <h2>GPU Composited</h2>\n        <p>Driven by lightweight CSS radial gradients updated via requestAnimationFrame.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"bento-card\">\n        <div class=\"bento-badge\">03 // TOKENS</div>\n        <h2>OKLCH Ready</h2>\n        <p>Subtle specular highlights with crisp 1px inner hairlines.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"bento-card span-2\">\n        <div class=\"bento-badge\">04 // DROP-IN PORTABILITY</div>\n        <h2>Copy Single-File or Folder Path</h2>\n        <p>Drop this bento grid directly into landing pages, changelogs, or developer documentation.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script>\n(function () {\n  const grid = document.getElementById('bentoGrid');\n  const cards = document.querySelectorAll('.bento-card');\n\n  grid.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n    cards.forEach((card) => {\n      const rect = card.getBoundingClientRect();\n      const x = e.clientX - rect.left;\n      const y = e.clientY - rect.top;\n      card.style.setProperty('--x', `${x}px`);\n      card.style.setProperty('--y', `${y}px`);\n    });\n  });\n})();\n\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Cursor-Tracked Spotlight Bento Grid</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"bento-stage\">\n    <div class=\"bento-grid\" id=\"bentoGrid\">\n      <article class=\"bento-card span-2\">\n        <div class=\"bento-badge\">01 // ZERO-DEPENDENCY EXTRACTION</div>\n        <h2>Self-Contained Component Bundles</h2>\n        <p>Every card tracks your cursor in real time, illuminating adjacent 1px borders even before the pointer enters the card boundary.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"bento-card\">\n        <div class=\"bento-badge\">02 // 60FPS</div>\n        <h2>GPU Composited</h2>\n        <p>Driven by lightweight CSS radial gradients updated via requestAnimationFrame.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"bento-card\">\n        <div class=\"bento-badge\">03 // TOKENS</div>\n        <h2>OKLCH Ready</h2>\n        <p>Subtle specular highlights with crisp 1px inner hairlines.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"bento-card span-2\">\n        <div class=\"bento-badge\">04 // DROP-IN PORTABILITY</div>\n        <h2>Copy Single-File or Folder Path</h2>\n        <p>Drop this bento grid directly into landing pages, changelogs, or developer documentation.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
