      "combined": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Vivienne Mgmt — Full Website &amp; CMS Template</title>\n  <style>\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody, html {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  background: #141413;\n  color: #f4f1ea;\n  font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.tpl-card {\n  height: 100vh;\n  padding: 22px 26px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  background: radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(230, 204, 178, 0.16), transparent 55%), #141413;\n}\n\n.tpl-header {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-family: monospace;\n  letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n}\n\n.tpl-badge {\n  padding: 4px 10px;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  background: rgba(230, 204, 178, 0.14);\n  color: #e6ccb2;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(230, 204, 178, 0.35);\n}\n\n.tpl-path {\n  color: #a8a29e;\n}\n\n.tpl-preview-visual {\n  position: relative;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(244, 241, 234, 0.14);\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1f1d1b, #141413);\n  padding: 28px;\n}\n\n.sim-kicker {\n  font-size: 10px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  color: #e6ccb2;\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.sim-overlay h1 {\n  font-size: 24px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.sim-overlay p {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.55;\n  color: #d6d3d1;\n  max-width: 540px;\n}\n\n.tpl-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.tpl-btn {\n  padding: 10px 16px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  border: 1px solid transparent;\n}\n\n.tpl-btn.primary {\n  background: #e6ccb2;\n  color: #141413;\n}\n\n.tpl-btn.secondary {\n  background: rgba(244, 241, 234, 0.08);\n  color: #f4f1ea;\n  border-color: rgba(244, 241, 234, 0.18);\n}\n\n.tpl-btn.ghost {\n  background: transparent;\n  color: #a8a29e;\n  border-color: rgba(244, 241, 234, 0.12);\n}\n\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"tpl-card\">\n    <div class=\"tpl-header\">\n      <span class=\"tpl-badge\">FULL WEBSITE + LIVE ADMIN CMS</span>\n      <span class=\"tpl-path\">/home/edvins/features-for-web/vivmgmt</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tpl-preview-visual\">\n      <div class=\"sim-overlay\">\n        <span class=\"sim-kicker\">VIVMGMT // PARIS &bull; NEW YORK</span>\n        <h1>5-Column Parallax Roster &amp; Editorial Archive</h1>\n        <p>Complete representation template with split-screen entrance choreography, 5-column wheel/mouse parallax, artist lightbox monographs, and live `admin.html` CMS.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tpl-actions\">\n      <a class=\"tpl-btn primary\" href=\"../../../vivmgmt/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Launch Full Live Website &nearr;</a>\n      <a class=\"tpl-btn secondary\" href=\"../../../vivmgmt/admin.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Visual Admin CMS &nearr;</a>\n      <button class=\"tpl-btn ghost\" id=\"copyCmdBtn\" type=\"button\">Copy Folder Path</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <script>\n(function () {\n  const btn = document.getElementById('copyCmdBtn');\n  if (!btn) return;\n  btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const path = '/home/edvins/features-for-web/vivmgmt';\n    if (navigator.clipboard) navigator.clipboard.writeText(path);\n    btn.textContent = 'Copied: ' + path;\n    setTimeout(() => { btn.textContent = 'Copy Folder Path'; }, 1800);\n  });\n})();\n\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Vivienne Mgmt — Full Website &amp; CMS Template</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"tpl-card\">\n    <div class=\"tpl-header\">\n      <span class=\"tpl-badge\">FULL WEBSITE + LIVE ADMIN CMS</span>\n      <span class=\"tpl-path\">/home/edvins/features-for-web/vivmgmt</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tpl-preview-visual\">\n      <div class=\"sim-overlay\">\n        <span class=\"sim-kicker\">VIVMGMT // PARIS &bull; NEW YORK</span>\n        <h1>5-Column Parallax Roster &amp; Editorial Archive</h1>\n        <p>Complete representation template with split-screen entrance choreography, 5-column wheel/mouse parallax, artist lightbox monographs, and live `admin.html` CMS.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tpl-actions\">\n      <a class=\"tpl-btn primary\" href=\"../../../vivmgmt/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Launch Full Live Website &nearr;</a>\n      <a class=\"tpl-btn secondary\" href=\"../../../vivmgmt/admin.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Visual Admin CMS &nearr;</a>\n      <button class=\"tpl-btn ghost\" id=\"copyCmdBtn\" type=\"button\">Copy Folder Path</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
